   ["And do you have any painkillers for children?","ਅਤੇ ਕੀ ਤੁਹਾਡੇ ਕੋਲ ਬੱਚਿਆਂ ਲਈ ਕੋਈ ਦਰਦ-ਨਿਵਾਰਕ ਦਵਾਈ ਹੈ?","92a7c00c-c8e9-447d-b822-048ead6c3a43","17ea1ae5-ab65-4c09-8dc1-cb25b0735a96"]
  ],
  "eng_for_pan:pod-1:SC10-S04": [
   ["I think so,","ਮੈਨੂੰ ਲੱਗਦਾ ਹੈ ਕਿ ਹੈ,","083c1b13-324a-46db-9451-ad584921519f","1f27fc24-d026-4877-b22c-5beeed7d75af"],
   ["but you'll have to look to make sure.","ਪਰ ਪੱਕਾ ਕਰਨ ਲਈ ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ ਦੇਖਣਾ ਪਵੇਗਾ।","82613111-5337-40a3-ab31-a9c5c8584196","8e7983ee-3af7-4001-8782-45c9805be70a"]
  ],
  "eng_for_pan:pod-1:SC10-S05": [
   ["I also need to get some sunscreen","ਮੈਨੂੰ ਕੁਝ ਧੁੱਪ ਤੋਂ ਬਚਾਅ ਵਾਲੀ ਕਰੀਮ","8df4d983-9738-4680-b309-bafa3b4d4956","a0b5d605-b1ee-42d6-81e8-20d4c15c96e8"],
   ["and some toothpaste.","ਅਤੇ ਕੁਝ ਟੂਥਪੇਸਟ ਵੀ ਲੈਣੀ ਹੈ।","aee53ccf-1f3f-49d4-989c-96606684c866","9cb175c2-390b-40f5-89fe-4f7ebcf86307"]
  ],
  "eng_for_pan:pod-1:SC10-S06": [
   ["Sunscreen is down there on your right,","ਧੁੱਪ ਤੋਂ ਬਚਾਅ ਵਾਲੀ ਕਰੀਮ ਉੱਥੇ ਹੇਠਾਂ ਤੁਹਾਡੇ ਸੱਜੇ ਪਾਸੇ ਹੈ,","f3d54e12-858b-4a6a-86ea-2911127e1cb1","631ff2be-6fd1-493a-8fdc-22ebd482ee06"],
   ["and you'll find toothpaste just round the corner.","ਅਤੇ ਟੂਥਪੇਸਟ ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ ਨੁੱਕਰ ਦੇ ਕੋਲ ਮਿਲ ਜਾਵੇਗੀ।","e6b8c96d-d7c9-48e1-8e08-d816b98d60e2","e0d63d1b-c7df-4323-b1f9-bb1ead611be5"]
  ],
  "eng_for_pan:pod-1:SC10-S07": [
   ["Thank you, you've been very helpful.","ਧੰਨਵਾਦ, ਤੁਸੀਂ ਬਹੁਤ ਮਦਦਗਾਰ ਰਹੇ।","73098d09-784b-4315-9ee0-5a72f5eb7497","063ff84d-123b-45d8-8ff6-6b53d2c9d7d8"],
   ["I'm very grateful.","ਮੈਂ ਬਹੁਤ ਸ਼ੁਕਰਗੁਜ਼ਾਰ ਹਾਂ।","183c9aab-6cc8-4ef7-a550-78a8a5054418","009445d5-e402-43d8-9b20-36da694f67d6"]
  ],
  "eng_for_pan:pod-1:SC10-S08": [
   ["You're welcome.","ਤੁਹਾਡਾ ਸਵਾਗਤ ਹੈ।","5d55041c-5685-48c7-9859-fde2677a459f","4cb1f9d8-5983-420e-bed8-b59384ae3f20"],
   ["Are you here on holiday?","ਕੀ ਤੁਸੀਂ ਇੱਥੇ ਛੁੱਟੀਆਂ ਮਨਾਉਣ ਆਏ ਹੋ?","909170cd-510c-4d58-8f30-89233fe84c43","1fd428aa-87c9-4cdd-b2fa-14c18ba932e1"],
   ["You speak very good English.","ਤੁਸੀਂ ਬਹੁਤ ਵਧੀਆ ਅੰਗਰੇਜ਼ੀ ਬੋਲਦੇ ਹੋ।","d930f751-8149-409f-995b-67eb885cda2c","ca63bff7-d8ad-4e82-a557-001ec661fd6a"]
  ],
  "eng_for_pan:pod-1:SC10-S09": [
   ["That's very kind of you!","ਇਹ ਤੁਹਾਡੀ ਬਹੁਤ ਮਿਹਰਬਾਨੀ ਹੈ!","c2c7822d-85f6-4eea-9869-edd3f40db30f","f5220d51-a4b7-42bf-af85-527b0412fe53"],
   ["Yes, I'm on holiday,","ਹਾਂ, ਮੈਂ ਛੁੱਟੀਆਂ 'ਤੇ ਹਾਂ,","de432528-dcca-4ce7-83d7-9b34da210201","8971fce1-be35-4547-b51e-2b6009b465f2"],
   ["and I need to practice more to speak English better.","ਅਤੇ ਮੈਨੂੰ ਅੰਗਰੇਜ਼ੀ ਹੋਰ ਚੰਗੀ ਤਰ੍ਹਾਂ ਬੋਲਣ ਲਈ ਜ਼ਿਆਦਾ ਅਭਿਆਸ ਕਰਨ ਦੀ ਲੋੜ ਹੈ।","79020d4b-c54c-44ba-a30e-8db0412dc309","effe8797-6804-4d72-9edf-0f7a8b2a1777"],
   ["Thank you very much, and goodbye.","ਤੁਹਾਡਾ ਬਹੁਤ-ਬਹੁਤ ਧੰਨਵਾਦ, ਅਤੇ ਅਲਵਿਦਾ।","9dbc5c36-be61-49de-91f1-b5901009c321","d663a3fd-7575-488f-b249-f6239afaa476"]
